# LAST AISLE - animals.art
# Strays, cats, foxes and rats seen from directly above, facing RIGHT (+x), pivot = body centre.
# _walk [0] stride (top-front + bottom-back leg forward), [1] feet under, [2] the other stride, [3] feet under
# _bite [0] crouched to spring, [1] the lunge, jaws open; _rest lying down; _dead [0] on its side, [1] torn up.
# Shared marks so one @swap turns an animal rabid: eyes '2' (-> red), muzzle '3' / nose 'P' (-> foam).
# Light from the top-left, 1px dark outline.

